<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56354" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεγχρ-ίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like millet</i>,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεγχρίας</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i> (q.v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind
			of <i>stone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.188
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> a bird, <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.
				<u>Av.</u>
				3.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> fem.<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεγχρ-ῖτις</span></b> , ἡ<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἰσχάς</span>
			<i>a dried fig</i> (from its number of grains), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.231
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a fabulous
			plant, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fluv.</u>
				19.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
